Constant tables inside the vendored engines
-------------------------------------------

Some files in Engine/sam, Engine/anna and Engine/onecore are constant tables that their upstream projects generated
from the original Windows engine DLLs (for example the abbreviation, lexicon, part-of-speech and character-class
tables, and codec and vocoder constants). They are part of the upstream projects' published sources and are
included here exactly as the upstream projects distribute them. The MIT licences above are the upstream authors'
licences; this project makes no claim that those licences cover material that originates in Microsoft's binaries.


